('127.699.d.4.C',4,'LiDAR is a sensing system that uses:','["heat blankets", "laser pulses to measure distances", "sound recording", "paper drawings"]'::jsonb,1,'LiDAR measures distance with lasers.','original'),
('127.699.d.4.D',3,'To map cave interiors where GPS signals can''t reach, a team might choose:','["a paper atlas", "a satellite photo", "an unmanned ground or aerial platform with onboard sensors", "a weather report"]'::jsonb,2,'Platforms must fit conditions.','original'),
('127.699.d.4.D',4,'A team compares drones and satellites for monthly crop checks over a small farm. The drone is often chosen because it offers:','["worldwide coverage", "orbit access", "no battery needs", "higher detail and flexible timing"]'::jsonb,3,'Drones suit small, frequent surveys.','original'),
('127.699.d.5.A',3,'After analyzing GIS data, a team notices gaps in the data. This is:','["a potential problem to evaluate", "an end to the project", "a perfect result", "a printer error"]'::jsonb,0,'Gaps affect reliability.','original'),
