('127.699.d.5.C',3,'A raster stores a landscape as:','["a grid of cells, each with a value", "a single point", "a paragraph", "a list of sentences"]'::jsonb,0,'Raster data is cell-based.','original'),
('127.699.d.5.C',4,'Querying a raster to find all cells with slopes above 20 degrees selects:','["no cells", "the cells that meet the slope condition", "every cell", "only the borders"]'::jsonb,1,'Queries filter cell values.','original'),
