('127.699.d.7.A',3,'Collecting the boundary of a school campus with GPS requires:','["walking the edge and recording points", "skipping the edge", "staying home", "drawing from memory"]'::jsonb,0,'Boundaries are captured by tracing.','original'),
('127.699.d.7.A',4,'Using an unmanned system to map a campus, the team must also follow:','["club rules only", "safety and flight regulations", "no rules", "only personal preference"]'::jsonb,1,'Drone use is regulated.','original'),
('127.699.d.7.B',3,'A community near a river may face a hardship such as:','["few clouds", "no sunsets", "flooding", "too many stars"]'::jsonb,2,'Location affects hazards.','original'),
('127.699.d.7.B',4,'A town with a nearby lake and farmland benefits from resources like:','["only paper", "no resources", "only shadows", "water and fertile soil"]'::jsonb,3,'Location shapes resources.','original'),
('127.699.d.7.C',3,'A campus map should show buildings, facilities and:','["adjacent streets", "only the sky", "random doodles", "nothing else"]'::jsonb,0,'Context locates the site.','original'),
('127.699.d.7.C',4,'A good facility map includes a legend that explains:','["the lunch menu", "the symbols for buildings and features", "the phone number", "the weather"]'::jsonb,1,'Legends explain symbols.','original'),
('127.699.d.7.D',3,'A map categorizing restrooms, entrances and parking helps visitors:','["lose the way", "avoid the building", "find what they need", "skip reading"]'::jsonb,2,'Categories organize features.','original'),
('127.699.d.7.D',4,'Adding an accessibility category to a facility map helps:','["no one", "only the designer", "only the printer", "users find ramps and accessible entrances"]'::jsonb,3,'Accessibility information serves users.','original'),
('127.699.d.8.A',3,'A spatial technology portfolio includes:','["evidence of skills such as maps, projects and certificates", "only a blank folder", "only jokes", "only passwords"]'::jsonb,0,'Portfolios document attainments.','original'),
('127.699.d.8.A',4,'Items that belong in a portfolio of spatial work include:','["unrelated photos", "completed maps, project reports and certifications", "spam emails", "unfinished doodles"]'::jsonb,1,'Include evidence of achievement.','original'),
